 radar    A   History   Settings (,)                                                                                                                ◉ read only
╭ 1 settings ──────────╮╭ 2 mode ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮╭ 3 the modes ───────────────────────────────────────╮
│General               ││ WHAT RADAR MAY CHANGE                                                          ││ ● read only                                        │
│  ├─ parts            ││                                                                                ││     changes nothing anywhere: every write is shown │
│  ├─ mode             ││ mode    read only                                                              ││ and asked, and none is sent                        │
│  ├─ appearance       ││         set by RADAR_MODE                                                      ││   write                                            │
│  ├─ colours          ││                                                                                ││     may add things: comments, replies, reactions,  │
