│                      ││                                                                                ││                                                    │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ Local actions (check out, an editor, a terminal)   │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ and settings work in every mode.                   │
│                      ││                                                                                ││ RADAR_MODE sets it for one run: read-only, write   │
